  @name "ACT4: Essosi Bargains"
  @first "T241 - ACT4 - The Kingsroad Blackmail Ledger after the feast"
  @sections "T241 - ACT4 - The Kingsroad Blackmail Ledger after the feast" "T242 - ACT4 - The Red Keep Raven Intercept before the sept bell" "T243 - ACT4 - Winterfell Night Council before witnesses" "T244 - ACT4 - The Twins Debt Collection under wolf banners" "T245 - ACT4 - Harrenhal Torchlit Census at the rookery" "T246 - ACT4 - Dragonstone Blood Price at first light" "T247 - ACT4 - Blackwater Bay Sealed Bargain beneath lion seals" "T248 - ACT4 - The Dreadfort Border Muster in crowded galleries" "T249 - ACT4 - The Eyrie Crown Ultimatum by candle smoke" "T250 - ACT4 - Pentos Harbor Ambush in river fog" "T251 - ACT4 - Qarth Alliance Split near the godswood" "T252 - ACT4 - The Wall War Map against old law" "T253 - ACT4 - Castle Black Inheritance Claim under moonless sky" "T254 - ACT4 - Moat Cailin Whispered Warning at the gatehouse" "T255 - ACT4 - Oldtown Silent Betrayal behind closed doors" "T256 - ACT4 - Pyke Hostage Exchange at the broken tower" "T257 - ACT4 - Highgarden Siege Promise in the throne shadow" "T258 - ACT4 - Sunspear Prison Confession with steel drawn" "T259 - ACT4 - The Trident Salt Pact by the harbor chain" "T260 - ACT4 - Riverrun Broken Oath under rain" "T261 - ACT4 - The Kingsroad Blackmail Ledger after the feast" "T262 - ACT4 - The Red Keep Raven Intercept before the sept bell" "T263 - ACT4 - Winterfell Night Council before witnesses" "T264 - ACT4 - The Twins Debt Collection under wolf banners"
__scene

section__
  @title "T241 - ACT4 - The Kingsroad Blackmail Ledger after the feast"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "medium"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/04-act4-essos/frame-241.jpg"

  "Pentos reeks of tar, cloves, and wet rope where your clerks uncrate ledgers seized during the crownland spy war. Some pages carry Littlefinger's cipher marks, others Varys's false flour counts, and all of them point to the same truth: half your promised grain was sold twice before it reached your camps. Jorah Mormont waits in plain view beside your banner while Illyrio Mopatis keeps his hands warm over a brazier and prices your desperation.

You need foreign coin now, not in a month. Sellsword companies on the quay want advance pay before they march, and the ship captains want collateral before they load so much as one barrel. If you miss tonight's contracts, your campaign tempo dies and your rivals reclaim the roads by morning. If you sign recklessly, Valehart becomes debtor to men who collect with knives.

Your scribes whisper the tally as if numbers might soften it: honor=${honor}, ruthlessness=${ruthlessness}, secrecy=${secrecy}, leverage=${leverage}, war_readiness=${war_readiness}, wealth=${wealth}, north_trust=${north_trust}, crown_trust=${crown_trust}, watch_trust=${watch_trust}, essos_ties=${essos_ties}, dragon_factor=${dragon_factor}, survival_clock=${survival_clock}. Every line is a debt or a threat, and both are due."

  choice__
    @target "T242 - ACT4 - The Red Keep Raven Intercept before the sept bell"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action essos_ties = clampStat(essos_ties + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Publish the Pentoshi financing terms before witnesses, pay the reputational cost openly, and lock captains into declared obligations"
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "T243 - ACT4 - Winterfell Night Council before witnesses"
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action wealth = clampStat(wealth + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Route emergency coin through Illyrio's private books, buy immediate control, and hide the long debt from your own court"
  __choice
__section

section__
  @title "T242 - ACT4 - The Red Keep Raven Intercept before the sept bell"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/04-act4-essos/frame-242.jpg"

  "Dust hangs in the caravanserai like old smoke while Daenerys Targaryen reads your draft terms without blinking. Daario Naharis lounges beside a cracked pillar, counting exits instead of words, and the captains of three free companies wait in the courtyard with helmets under their arms. They have not been paid in full for two moons. Men who go unpaid do not mutiny all at once; they slip away in squads and sell their spears to whoever has heavier chests.

This is the first pressure point of Act 4: money is command. If you cannot align contract, coin, and timetable, no banner oath from Westeros matters. Agreeing in public secures legitimacy but exposes every shortage. Bargaining in shadow gives you speed but invites blackmail the moment somebody copies the ledger.

You feel heat from the braziers through your gloves and hear gulls screaming over the harbor as if they can smell the dead before battle. The next signature decides whether your army marches as a coalition or fractures into hired knives."

  choice__
    @target "T243 - ACT4 - Winterfell Night Council before witnesses"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action essos_ties = clampStat(essos_ties + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Read Daenerys's terms before the assembled captains, concede the visible coin loss, and force every company to sign under seal"
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "T244 - ACT4 - The Twins Debt Collection under wolf banners"
    @when ((secrecy + leverage) >= 7)
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action wealth = clampStat(wealth + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Bribe rival lieutenants with quiet silver and edited ledgers, trading legitimacy for fast leverage inside their command tent"
  __choice
__section

section__
  @title "T243 - ACT4 - Winterfell Night Council before witnesses"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "wide"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/04-act4-essos/frame-243.jpg"

  "On the slavers' quay, chains knock against stone pilings with a sound like distant bells. A northern courier stands beside your table in sea-stiff wool, waiting for proof that Valehart still means to honor grain promises made before the Trident roads burned. Across from him, Daario's brokers insist no cargo leaves Pentos until hostages are exchanged and port fees are doubled for wartime risk.

Every delay sharpens two blades at once. If the North reads your Essosi bargaining as betrayal, you lose trust needed for winter levies. If the Essosi lenders read you as sentimental, they raise rates until your war chest bleeds out. The bargain has to satisfy men who despise each other and still keep your troops fed.

Salt spray stings your lips while scribes blot ink with shaking hands. By sunrise, either your commitments will align into one strategy or your allies will start treating Valehart promises as weather talk."

  choice__
    @target "T244 - ACT4 - The Twins Debt Collection under wolf banners"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action essos_ties = clampStat(essos_ties + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Confirm the northern grain pledge in writing before witnesses, accept tighter margins, and keep allied trust above short-term profit"
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "T245 - ACT4 - Harrenhal Torchlit Census at the rookery"
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action wealth = clampStat(wealth + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
