section__
  @title "T247 - ACT4 - Blackwater Bay Sealed Bargain beneath lion seals"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "medium"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/04-act4-essos/frame-247.jpg"

  "Night settles over the caravanserai in red dust and lamp smoke while two Blackwater intermediaries present lion-stamped bonds for ships, pitch, and bolts. Daenerys's camp expects your answer before moonset; Daario's captains expect coin in hand before first watch. No one here is neutral anymore. Everyone is pricing your urgency.

You can formalize a convoy pact in front of harbor magistrates, paying higher tariffs and exposing every clause to scrutiny. That route limits treachery but drains coin and time. Or you can issue side letters to handpicked captains, undercut rivals, and move matériel immediately through deniable channels. It is faster, cheaper up front, and corrosive to every future negotiation.

The brass scales on the money table click with each weight added, a small metallic heartbeat while men decide who eats and who burns."

  choice__
    @target "T248 - ACT4 - The Dreadfort Border Muster in crowded galleries"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action essos_ties = clampStat(essos_ties + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Ratify a lawful convoy accord before harbor witnesses, pay heavier tariffs, and secure transparent delivery lanes"
  __choice

