section__
  @title "T251 - ACT4 - Qarth Alliance Split near the godswood"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/04-act4-essos/frame-251.jpg"

  "Under carved cedar beams imported from Qarth, two delegations who were allies yesterday now arrive through separate doors. One offers credit and grain futures if you distance yourself from Daenerys's hardline captains. The other offers ships and veterans if you publicly denounce the financiers as slavers in silk. Both insist the split is temporary. Both are lying.

Your quartermasters have already begun loyalty rationing, and word of that has reached every campfire between Pentos and the Trident. If you broker this rupture in daylight, you may lose speed but keep a coalition that can survive audits and rumor. If you secretly feed one side forged intelligence on the other, you gain short leverage and invite long reprisals the moment forged pages surface.

Resin smoke from the braziers coats your tongue. You can still choose a stable architecture for foreign support, but only if you decide which faction can hurt you less when it feels betrayed."

  choice__
    @target "T252 - ACT4 - The Wall War Map against old law"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action essos_ties = clampStat(essos_ties + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Broker terms in open council with signed witnesses, paying the time cost to keep your foreign bloc politically coherent"
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "T253 - ACT4 - Castle Black Inheritance Claim under moonless sky"
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
