This pact is your last chance to consolidate foreign logistics before the act turns seaward. Open terms can keep middle houses in line and give you enforceable records when betrayal comes. A covert framework can cut better rates and reserve routes for loyalists, but once discovered it makes every neutral captain treat you as another predator with better seals.

